  "paragraphs": [
    [
      "P001",
      "26A Thrust bearings (18) can be removed by WORKING AGAINST THE INNER RACE OF THE\nINNER MOST BEARING. (Refer to Figure 6)\nWARNING ! !",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P002",
      "Failure to use this procedure can damage the bearing.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P003",
      "27A Slide thrust bearing cartridge (141) off shaft.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P004",
      "28A",
      false,
      "heading",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P005",
      "If pump was provided with grease seals (51) for the thrust (37) and radial (35) bearing covers and\nthe thrust bearing cartridge (141) these should be inspected for any visible damage and replaced,\nif necessary.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P006",
      "29A Pump is now completely disassembled with the exception of the wear rings (8 & 25) and stuffing\nbox bushing (15 & 27, if supplied).",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P007",
      "All of these items have an interference fit with their respective\npieces.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P008",
      "To disassemble, remove their respective locking devices and pry out working uniformly at\n180° points.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P009",
      "NOTE: Wear rings and stuffing box bushings should not be removed unless it is necessary to replace\nthem with new parts.",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P010",
      "18",
      false,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S001"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P011",
      "2)\nMODEL FS PUMPS ONLY (Continued from Step No. 7, Page 16).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P012",
      "NOTE: If pump is a Model F pump, disregard 8B - 24B, and continue with Steps 8A - 29A on page\n16.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P013",
      "Step\n8B\nUnbolt and remove bearing cover (37).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P014",
      "This procedure disconnects Item 51 from Item 33.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P015",
      "9B",
      true,
      "heading",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P016",
      "Unbolt and remove radial bearing housing (33).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P017",
      "10B Remove locknut (22) and lockwasher (69).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P018",
      "11B To remove the radial bearing (16), place puller around the bearing spacer (78) using the groove.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P019",
      "Do not apply puller to grease retainer (51).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P020",
      "Pull bearing spacer (78) from shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P021",
      "Radial bearing (16)\nand grease retainer (51) will slide off along with the bearing spacer (78).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P022",
      "12B Remove thrust bearing (18) and springs.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P023",
      "Retain the springs.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P024",
      "They must be re-installed at\nassembly.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P025",
      "13B Remove thrust bearing housing (31).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P026",
      "The oil retainer (107) is bolted to the bearing housing and\nwill come out with the housing.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P027",
      "14B Slide flinger seal (40b) off of shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P028",
      "15B Remove packing gland (17).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P029",
      "16B Loosen set screws and turn shaft sleeve nut (20) off of shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P030",
      "17B Remove packing rings (13) - slide lantern ring (29) from shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "18B Remove bolting from impeller nut (26) - turn impeller nut from shaft and slide the impeller (2) from\nthe shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "Retain the impeller key for use at assembly.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P033",
      "19B Remove bolting from retaining ring (1 80) and slide the lower bearing housing (99) from the volute\ncover (11).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P034",
      "Retain locking key - it must be used at assembly.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P035",
      "20B Carefully slide the shaft (6) from the volute cover (11).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P036",
      "It will contain the shaft journal\n(74) locknut (22-I) and shaft sleeve (14).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P037",
      "21B Slide the shaft sleeve (14) from the shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P038",
      "Pin must be used at assembly.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P039",
      "22B To remove shaft journal (74), loosen set screw and turn journal locknut (22-I) from\nshaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P040",
      "Slide shaft journal (74) from shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P041",
      "Handle with care.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P042",
      "23B To remove bearing bushing (39), remove locking plate and press out of housing using a follower\nas large as bore in piece (99) will permit.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P043",
      "24B Pump is now completely disassembled with the exception of the wear rings (8 & 25, if supplied).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "23:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S002"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P044",
      "These items have an interference fit with their respective pieces.",
